  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e641e74f0ba9b43d",
      "translationZh": "为模组添加了 .ui.selection()：返回您在全屏模式下最后选择的文本，并且当选择位于单个转录行内时，返回该行",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2984eb2fff14878",
      "translationZh": "为没有 GitHub CLI 的云会话镜像添加了内置 gh API，并修复了将文件名、jq 过滤器或 GitHub 错误中的控制字符发送到终端的问题",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce2dbc2a31e4c02d",
      "translationZh": "添加了针对使用 Ctrl+C 清除的提示词的恢复功能：在空提示词上按向上键可恢复草稿，包括粘贴的文本和图片",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a5e4dec71640dac",
      "translationZh": "当 MCP 服务器在工具调用期间请求更多 OAuth 范围时，添加了重新认证提示",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d75104f911b409d7",
      "translationZh": "为 /code-review 添加了 --max-findings <n>|all，以报告比通常限制更多或更少的发现；该选择将被重复使用，直到您传递 --max-findings default",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f8fd1f098a17431",
      "translationZh": "添加了 Ctrl+F 以按名称查找会话，以及 Alt+↑/↓ 以在代理视图中在组之间跳转；两者以及重命名都可以在 keybindings. 中重新绑定",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "681b4f78910e28f4",
      "translationZh": "添加了在批准计划时对新的权限模式的屏幕阅读器模式公告，包括使用 Shift+Tab 时",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aea0c7ba9924273c",
      "translationZh": "修复了响应中途 API 超时导致回合失败的问题：非交互式会话和子代理现在将从部分响应继续，并且仅思考响应会被重试",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "820dbd1b81ae7c24",
      "translationZh": "修复了长对话在最后一条回复报告零 token 使用量时，未能自动压缩而是报错“Prompt is too long”的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b71875c169e1824",
      "translationZh": "修复了 --resume 有时会在压缩刚刚恢复文件和其他上下文后丢失这些内容的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0b39cf51484c91e",
      "translationZh": "修复了恢复会话有时未保存一轮对话的最后一个回复，导致下一次 --resume 显示提示未被回答的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c4cea78d0ae1edc",
      "translationZh": "修复了恢复时偶尔加载到被截断的记录，因为同一会话在加载过程中重写了文件。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3d204691a89b199",
      "translationZh": "修复了恢复在 2.1.286 或更早版本开始的对话时，丢失模型早期思考内容的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "621ba73a5af94556",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 Mantle 上或在被拒绝结构化输出的网关后，会话标题、记忆回忆和提示钩子失效的问题；添加了 CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_STRUCTURED_OUTPUTS 以关闭结构化输出。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dbb966e74ec1fdb3",
      "translationZh": "修复了当被阻止的工具不是 Bash 时，自动模式拒绝指向 Claude 的 Bash 权限规则的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f9aaaebe94b56c4",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 Bedrock 和 Mantle 上，在请求旧模型（如 WebFetch 摘要或 sonnet 子代理）后，自动模式在会话剩余时间内切换到本地分类器的问题。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8d24c214f370c5b",
      "translationZh": "固定的云会话在重新选择模型后重新启动，并在服务器拒绝该模型后使用该模型进行回复",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    }
  ],
